or: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">there</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">Here a</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(242,141,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">moo</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">, there a moo,</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">Everywhere a</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(242,141,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">moo moo</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">Old MacDonald had a farm</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">E-I-E-I-O!</span><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">Sing this lots of times, but each time you sing, change the animal name and the noise it makes!</span>&nbsp;</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 211, "name": "Old MacDonald", "logCreatedAt": "2023-05-24T11:46:30.058434", "logUpdatedAt": "2023-05-24T11:46:30.058434", "logCreatedById": 21670528, "logUpdatedById": 21670528, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 4, "btnType": "SECONDARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'c